-* AlmaLinux-10 (e.g. [https://repo.almalinux.org/almalinux/10/](https://repo.almalinux.org/almalinux/10/))
-* EPEL 10 (e.g. [http://download.fedoraproject.org/pub/epel/10/](http://download.fedoraproject.org/pub/epel/10/))
