-With the provisioning services enabled, the next step is to define
-a system image that can subsequently be
-used to provision one or more *compute* nodes. The following subsections highlight this process.
-
-### Build initial BOS image
-
-The following steps illustrate the process to build a minimal, default image for use with {{ confluent }}. To begin, you will
-first need to have a local copy of the ISO image available for the underlying OS. In this recipe, the relevant ISO image
-is `{{ isoimage }}` (available from the {{ baseOS }}
-[download]({{ downloadpage }}) page).
-We initialize the image
-creation process using the `osdeploy` command assuming that the necessary ISO image is available locally in
-`${iso_path}` as follows:
-
-The `osdeploy initialize` command is used to prepare a confluent server to deploy deploy operating systems.
-For first time setup, run osdeploy initialize interactively to be walked through the various options using:
-`osdeploy initialize -i`
-
-<!-- begin_ohpc_run -->
-<!-- ohpc_comment_header Initialize OS images for use with Confluent \ref{sec:assemble_bos} -->
-```bash
-[sms]# osdeploy initialize -${initialize_options}
-[sms]# osdeploy import ${iso_path}
-
-```
-<!-- end_ohpc_run -->
-
-Once completed, OS image should be available for use within {{ confluent }}. These can be queried via:
-
-```bash
-# Query available images
-[sms]# osdeploy list
-Distributions:
-  alma-9.5-x86_64
-  rhel-9.5-x86_64
-  rocky-9.5-x86_64
-Profiles:
-  alma-9.5-x86_64-default
-  rhel-9.5-x86_64-default
-  rocky-9.5-x86_64-default
-```
-
-If needing to copy files from the sms node to the compute nodes during deployment, this can be done by
-modifying the syncfiles file that is created when `osdeploy import` command is run. For an environment
-that has no DNS server and needs to have /etc/hosts file synced amongst all the nodes, the following command
-should be run.
-
-<!-- begin_ohpc_run -->
-<!-- ohpc_validation_newline -->
-<!-- ohpc_validation_comment Sync the hosts file in cluster -->
-```bash
-[sms]# echo "/etc/hosts -> /etc/hosts" >> \
-	/var/lib/confluent/public/os/{{ confluentprofile }}/syncfiles
-
-```
-<!-- end_ohpc_run -->
