-## Inputs
-
-As this recipe details installing a cluster starting from bare-metal, there is a requirement to define IP addresses and
-gather hardware MAC addresses in order to support a controlled provisioning process. These values are necessarily unique
-to the hardware being used, and this document uses variable substitution (`${variable}`) in the command-line
-examples that follow to highlight where local site inputs are required. A summary of the required and optional variables
-used throughout this recipe are presented below. Note that while the example definitions above correspond to a small
-4-node compute subsystem, the compute parameters are defined in array format to accommodate logical extension to larger
-node counts.
-
-**Required variables:**
-
-* `${sms_name}` - Hostname for SMS server
-* `${sms_ip}` - Internal IP address on SMS server
-{% if isxCAT %}
-* `${domain_name}` - Local network domain name
-{% endif %}
-* `${sms_eth_internal}` - Internal Ethernet interface on SMS
-{% if isWarewulf %}
-* `${eth_provision}` - Provisioning interface for computes
-{% endif %}
-* `${internal_network}` - Subnet network address for internal network
-* `${internal_netmask}` - Subnet netmask for internal network
-{% if isWarewulf4 %}
-* `${ipv4_gateway}` - Default gateway for the internal network
-* `${dns_servers}` - DNS resolver for the internal network
-{% endif %}
-* `${ntp_server}` - Local ntp server for time synchronization
-* `${bmc_username}` - BMC username for use by IPMI
-* `${bmc_password}` - BMC password for use by IPMI
-* `${num_computes}` - Total # of desired compute nodes
-* `${c_ip[0]}`, `${c_ip[1]}`, ... - Desired compute node addresses
-* `${c_bmc[0]}`, `${c_bmc[1]}`, ... - BMC addresses for computes
-* `${c_mac[0]}`, `${c_mac[1]}`, ... - MAC addresses for computes
-* `${c_name[0]}`, `${c_name[1]}`, ... - Host names for computes
-* `${compute_regex}` - Regex matching all compute node names (e.g. "c*")
-* `${compute_prefix}` - Prefix for compute node names (e.g. "c")
-{% if isxCAT %}
-* `${iso_path}` - Directory location of OS iso for xCAT install
-{% if not isxCATstateful %}
-* `${synclist}` - Filesystem location of xCAT synclist file
-{% endif %}
-{% endif %}
-{% if isxCATstateful %}
-* `${ohpc_repo_dir}` - Directory location of local {{ ohpc }} repository mirror
-* `${epel_repo_dir}` - Directory location of local EPEL repository mirror
-{% endif %}
-{% if isWarewulf4 %}
-* `${node_disk}` - Device path for disk to be used for provision-to-disk
-{% endif %}
-
-**Optional variables:**
-
-{% if isx86 %}
-* `${sysmgmtd_host}` - BeeGFS System Management host name
-* `${mgs_fs_name}` - Lustre MGS mount name
-* `${sms_ipoib}` - IPoIB address for SMS server
-* `${ipoib_netmask}` - Subnet netmask for internal IPoIB
-* `${c_ipoib[0]}`, `${c_ipoib[1]}`, ... - IPoIB addresses for computes
-{% endif %}
-{% if isWarewulf %}
-* `${kargs}` - Kernel boot arguments
-{% endif %}
